{"slug":"Railroad","title":"Railroad","cats":[],"headings":[],"html":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/200px-RAILS.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"190\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"311\" data-file-height=\"296\"><figcaption>A <b>Railroad</b>.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>When a <a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">factory</a> and a <a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\">city</a> or <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">port</a> are placed near eachother,  <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">railroads</span> will be spawned to connect the <a href=\"/Buildings\" title=\"Buildings\">buildings</a> together. <a href=\"/Train\" title=\"Train\">Trains</a> may only travel where a Railroad exists.\n</p><p>Adding further <a href=\"/Buildings\" title=\"Buildings\">buildings</a> within this distance will cause more rail to be spawned, creating a mesh. It is also possible to make a <a href=\"/Train\" title=\"Train\">train</a> loop.\n</p><p>On launch, the following <a href=\"/Buildings\" title=\"Buildings\">buildings</a> are able to be connected:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">Factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\">City</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">Port</a></li></ul>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/200px-Factory_port_trains.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"149\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"457\" data-file-height=\"340\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Factory\" class=\"\" title=\"Factories\">Factories</a> and <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">ports</a> connected by <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">Railroads</span> with a <a href=\"/Train\" title=\"Train\">Train</a> on the tracks</figcaption></figure>\n<p><br>\nThe maximum distance within which a <a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">factory</a>, <a href=\"/City\" title=\"City\">city</a> or <a href=\"/Port\" title=\"Port\">port</a> can connect to another station to form a <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">railroad</span> is 80.\n</p><p>The maximum length that a single <span class=\"wiki-deadlink\">railroad</span> connection can be is 100.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_Also\">See Also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Buildings\" title=\"Buildings\">Buildings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Factory\" title=\"Factory\">Factory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Train\" title=\"Train\">Train</a></li></ul>","section":"Buildings"}
